<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><title>Private Call</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/style.css"><script src="/socket.io/socket.io.js" defer></script><script src="/assets/call.js" defer></script></head><body><header><b>✦ Private Call</b><form method="post" action="/logout"><button class="quiet">Lock / sign out</button></form></header><main class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">ONE-TO-ONE VIDEO</p><h1>Your private room</h1><p class="muted">Both people must unlock this site and enter the same room code.</p><section class="panel"><label for="code">Room code</label><div class="join"><input id="code" placeholder="e.g. BLUE42" maxlength="12" autocomplete="off"><button id="join" class="primary">Join room</button></div><p id="status" role="status">Not connected to a room.</p></section><section class="videos"><div class="video"><video id="remote" autoplay playsinline></video><span>Other person</span><p id="remote-empty">Waiting for the other person…</p></div><div class="video"><video id="local" autoplay playsinline muted></video><span>You</span><p id="local-empty">Your camera is off</p></div></section><section class="controls"><button id="camera" disabled>Start camera</button><button id="mute" disabled>Mute mic</button><button id="flip" disabled>Flip camera</button><button id="end" class="danger" disabled>End call</button></section><p class="fine">Camera/microphone access is requested only when you press Start camera. Don't share your room code publicly.</p></main></body></html>